6-10-18","field","reviewed","section","metadata","language","en","使用限制","Source reviewed, not run here. Native tools may be required. In the inspected code, reset(seed=...) seeds Gymnasium but does not set NetHack RNGs; use the explicit seed interface. NetHackChallenge deliberately disallows seed changes. Terminal/glyph observations are not RGB game frames.","limitations","guidance","list","配置步骤","ordered",true,"items",[79,80,81],"setup","Prepare Python 3.10+, CMake 3.28+ and the platform build prerequisites documented upstream.","Install nle, then run python -m nle.scripts.play --mode random.","Create NetHackScore-v0 with fixed observation_keys, actions and fix_moon_phase=True; before reset, call env.unwrapped.seed with recorded core, disp, reseed=False and optional lgen values.","可以尝试的任务",false,[86,87,88],"testTasks","Measure staircase or score-task progress with a fixed turn budget.","Test inventory decisions and recovery after invalid actions.","Modify a task reward or termination rule and replay baseline rollouts.","AI 使用与评估条件","An AI research interface; distinguish terminal rendering, symbols, text messages and internal state so planning results remain comparable.","aiUseNote","links","参考依据",[96,97,98],"evidence",{"_58":103,"_25":104},{"_58":101,"_25":102},{"_58":99,"_25":100},"Pinned observation, seed and reset implementation","https://github.com/NetHack-LE/nle/blob/2319f2989f0035685017e9ea13c83b2546fe477c/nle/env/base.py","Archived upstream repository","https://github.com/facebookresearch/nle","Maintained source, installation and play scripts","https://github.com/NetHack-LE/nle#readme","查看许可条款",[108],"licenseUrl",{"_58":105,"_25":109},"https://github.com/NetHack-LE/nle/blob/main/LICENSE","许可类别","开放许可资源","terms","provenance","资产许可","Bundled NetHack data follows repository notices; external tilesets are separate.","assetLicense","代码许可","NetHack General Public License; preserve notices and follow source/distribution obligations.","codeLicense","开始使用",[123],"access",{"_58":124,"_25":125,"_126":127},"Free package and source","https://github.com/NetHack-LE/nle#installation","note","Native compilation prerequisites may be needed; the repository includes interactive and random-agent scripts.","主要来源",[131],"sourceUrl",{"_58":128,"_25":132},"https://github.com/NetHack-LE/nle","技术栈","Python · C / C++ · Gymnasium · NetHack","stack","适用方向",[139],"dimensions","2D","测试目标",[143,144],"uses","代码修改与自动试玩","视觉、控制与规划","资源类型","AI 评估环境","lead","summary","environment",[161,162],[160],{"_58":124,"_25":125,"_126":127},"open",[157,158,159],[86,87,88],[79,80,81],{"_58":103,"_25":104},{"_58":101,"_25":102},{"_58":99,"_25":100},"2d","coding","playing",{"_164":165},"documents",{"_67":166,"_35":167},[169,173,174,175,172,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,171,208,170,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229],[168,169,170,171,172],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-design/LICENSE","design/des